&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve noticed nternal interface IgniteInternalCache.localPeek() has an ExpiryPolicy as one of it&apos;s argument.&lt;br/&gt;
Public IgniteCache interface method doesn&apos;t allow to use any ExpiryPolicy and it looks like we don&apos;t use it internally as well (neither in code nor in tests).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s drop dead and untested code.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
